{"video": "panetone", "titulo": "Por que o panetone só aparece no Natal?", "fps": 30, "durationInFrames": 1800, "durationSeconds": 60.0, "engine": "elevenlabs", "voz": {"estilo": "documentario", "ritmo": 1.057}, "scenes": [{"id": "gancho", "startFrame": 0, "endFrame": 85, "lines": [{"text": "Por que o panetone só aparece no Natal?", "startFrame": 3, "endFrame": 77, "words": [{"text": "Por", "startFrame": 7, "endFrame": 8}, {"text": "que", "startFrame": 9, "endFrame": 10}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 12, "endFrame": 13}, {"text": "panetone", "startFrame": 15, "endFrame": 31}, {"text": "só", "startFrame": 35, "endFrame": 38}, {"text": "aparece", "startFrame": 41, "endFrame": 54}, {"text": "no", "startFrame": 55, "endFrame": 56}, {"text": "Natal?", "startFrame": 58, "endFrame": 76}]}]}, {"id": "origem", "startFrame": 85, "endFrame": 422, "lines": [{"text": "Ele nasceu em Milão, na Itália.", "startFrame": 94, "endFrame": 158, "words": [{"text": "Ele", "startFrame": 98, "endFrame": 99}, {"text": "nasceu", "startFrame": 102, "endFrame": 110}, {"text": "em", "startFrame": 111, "endFrame": 112}, {"text": "Milão,", "startFrame": 114, "endFrame": 129}, {"text": "na", "startFrame": 130, "endFrame": 132}, {"text": "Itália.", "startFrame": 137, "endFrame": 157}]}, {"text": "Dizem que um ajudante chamado Toni o inventou numa ceia de Natal…", "startFrame": 169, "endFrame": 295, "words": [{"text": "Dizem", "startFrame": 170, "endFrame": 181}, {"text": "que", "startFrame": 182, "endFrame": 183}, {"text": "um", "startFrame": 185, "endFrame": 186}, {"text": "ajudante", "startFrame": 188, "endFrame": 202}, {"text": "chamado", "startFrame": 203, "endFrame": 215}, {"text": "Toni", "startFrame": 217, "endFrame": 231}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 232, "endFrame": 233}, {"text": "inventou", "startFrame": 236, "endFrame": 249}, {"text": "numa", "startFrame": 253, "endFrame": 258}, {"text": "ceia", "startFrame": 261, "endFrame": 267}, {"text": "de", "startFrame": 269, "endFrame": 270}, {"text": "Natal…", "startFrame": 272, "endFrame": 295}]}, {"text": "mas, pros historiadores, é só lenda.", "startFrame": 306, "endFrame": 414, "words": [{"text": "mas,", "startFrame": 314, "endFrame": 325}, {"text": "pros", "startFrame": 334, "endFrame": 341}, {"text": "historiadores,", "startFrame": 345, "endFrame": 375}, {"text": "é", "startFrame": 377, "endFrame": 379}, {"text": "só", "startFrame": 384, "endFrame": 390}, {"text": "lenda.", "startFrame": 393, "endFrame": 413}]}]}, {"id": "luxo", "startFrame": 422, "endFrame": 743, "lines": [{"text": "A verdade é mais simples: manteiga, ovos, açúcar e frutas eram caríssimos.", "startFrame": 431, "endFrame": 608, "words": [{"text": "A", "startFrame": 432, "endFrame": 433}, {"text": "verdade", "startFrame": 435, "endFrame": 449}, {"text": "é", "startFrame": 450, "endFrame": 451}, {"text": "mais", "startFrame": 452, "endFrame": 458}, {"text": "simples:", "startFrame": 460, "endFrame": 487}, {"text": "manteiga,", "startFrame": 491, "endFrame": 512}, {"text": "ovos,", "startFrame": 517, "endFrame": 528}, {"text": "açúcar", "startFrame": 532, "endFrame": 544}, {"text": "e", "startFrame": 545, "endFrame": 546}, {"text": "frutas", "startFrame": 549, "endFrame": 562}, {"text": "eram", "startFrame": 564, "endFrame": 574}, {"text": "caríssimos.", "startFrame": 578, "endFrame": 608}]}, {"text": "Então esse pão rico era guardado pra maior festa do ano.", "startFrame": 620, "endFrame": 734, "words": [{"text": "Então", "startFrame": 620, "endFrame": 629}, {"text": "esse", "startFrame": 632, "endFrame": 635}, {"text": "pão", "startFrame": 637, "endFrame": 642}, {"text": "rico", "startFrame": 645, "endFrame": 654}, {"text": "era", "startFrame": 656, "endFrame": 660}, {"text": "guardado", "startFrame": 665, "endFrame": 674}, {"text": "pra", "startFrame": 677, "endFrame": 681}, {"text": "maior", "startFrame": 684, "endFrame": 699}, {"text": "festa", "startFrame": 701, "endFrame": 713}, {"text": "do", "startFrame": 715, "endFrame": 717}, {"text": "ano.", "startFrame": 722, "endFrame": 735}]}]}, {"id": "trabalho", "startFrame": 743, "endFrame": 1012, "lines": [{"text": "E dá trabalho: a massa tradicional fermenta por mais de um dia,", "startFrame": 751, "endFrame": 888, "words": [{"text": "E", "startFrame": 751, "endFrame": 754}, {"text": "dá", "startFrame": 756, "endFrame": 758}, {"text": "trabalho:", "startFrame": 760, "endFrame": 789}, {"text": "a", "startFrame": 790, "endFrame": 792}, {"text": "massa", "startFrame": 796, "endFrame": 801}, {"text": "tradicional", "startFrame": 802, "endFrame": 822}, {"text": "fermenta", "startFrame": 824, "endFrame": 835}, {"text": "por", "startFrame": 839, "endFrame": 842}, {"text": "mais", "startFrame": 844, "endFrame": 851}, {"text": "de", "startFrame": 852, "endFrame": 853}, {"text": "um", "startFrame": 857, "endFrame": 860}, {"text": "dia,", "startFrame": 862, "endFrame": 887}]}, {"text": "e ainda esfria de cabeça pra baixo, pra não murchar!", "startFrame": 892, "endFrame": 1003, "words": [{"text": "e", "startFrame": 899, "endFrame": 910}, {"text": "ainda", "startFrame": 913, "endFrame": 919}, {"text": "esfria", "startFrame": 923, "endFrame": 935}, {"text": "de", "startFrame": 936, "endFrame": 938}, {"text": "cabeça", "startFrame": 940, "endFrame": 953}, {"text": "pra", "startFrame": 956, "endFrame": 960}, {"text": "baixo,", "startFrame": 963, "endFrame": 974}, {"text": "pra", "startFrame": 976, "endFrame": 978}, {"text": "não", "startFrame": 980, "endFrame": 983}, {"text": "murchar!", "startFrame": 986, "endFrame": 1003}]}]}, {"id": "fabrica", "startFrame": 1012, "endFrame": 1293, "lines": [{"text": "Há uns cem anos, Angelo Motta deixou o panetone alto, como a gente conhece.", "startFrame": 1020, "endFrame": 1154, "words": [{"text": "Há", "startFrame": 1020, "endFrame": 1023}, {"text": "uns", "startFrame": 1026, "endFrame": 1030}, {"text": "cem", "startFrame": 1033, "endFrame": 1036}, {"text": "anos,", "startFrame": 1041, "endFrame": 1052}, {"text": "Angelo", 